{"type":"message","id":"1d069065","parentId":"e12eb4cf","timestamp":"2026-03-10T04:09:46.417Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Initiating File Updates**\n\nI've just named myself '67' within `IDENTITY.md`. My next action is to gather the necessary details for both `IDENTITY.md` and `USER.md`, then discuss `SOUL.md` and connection possibilities, according to the directives in `BOOTSTRAP.md`.\n\n\n**Gathering Required Details**\n\nI've just added my designation '67' to `IDENTITY.md`. My focus is now on collecting information for both `IDENTITY.md` and `USER.md`, and then discussing `SOUL.md` and connection possibilities. I'll frame my request to the user in Korean, using the name they provided.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>제 이름이 67이라고 알려주셔서 감사합니다. 이제 제가 어떤 존재이고 어떤 느낌을 주는지, 그리고 저를 대표할 만한 이모지는 무엇이 좋을지 함께 정해볼까요? 그리고 사용자님의 성함과 제가 어떻게 불러드리면 좋을지도 알려주세요.</final>","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":10187,"output":142,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10329,"cost":{"input":0.0030561,"output":0.000355,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0034111}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773115783222}}
