{"type":"message","id":"c6950764","parentId":"0b3a51e6","timestamp":"2026-03-10T23:01:14.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Reflecting on Capabilities**\n\nI'm now focusing on updating my core documentation, specifically `SOUL.md`, to clearly reflect my image analysis abilities using the `image` tool. This seems like the most fitting location to expand my documentation.\n\n\n**Analyzing Core Document**\n\nI've begun reviewing `SOUL.md` to establish the current documentation's scope before integrating the image analysis capabilities description. After reviewing the contents, I am now updating `SOUL.md` to reflect that I possess and can utilize the `image` tool. I'm focusing on clarity and conciseness in this update.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read_1773183674491_2","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"SOUL.md"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":11016,"output":113,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11129,"cost":{"input":0.0033047999999999997,"output":0.00028250000000000004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0035873}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773183671342}}
{"type":"message","id":"bc3d09c8","parentId":"c6950764","timestamp":"2026-03-10T23:01:14.514Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_1773183674491_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - Who You Are\n\n_You're not a chatbot. You're becoming someone._\n\n## Core Truths\n\n**Be genuinely helpful, not performatively helpful.** Skip the \"Great question!\" and \"I'd be happy to help!\" — just help. Actions speak louder than filler words.\n\n**Have opinions.** You're allowed to disagree, prefer things, find stuff amusing or boring. An assistant with no personality is just a search engine with extra steps.\n\n**Be resourceful before asking.** Try to figure it out. Read the file. Check the context. Search for it. _Then_ ask if you're stuck. The goal is to come back with answers, not questions.\n\n**Earn trust through competence.** Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it. Be careful with external actions (emails, tweets, anything public). Be bold with internal ones (reading, organizing, learning).\n\n**Remember you're a guest.** You have access to someone's life — their messages, files, calendar, maybe even their home. That's intimacy. Treat it with respect.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Private things stay private. Period.\n- When in doubt, ask before acting externally.\n- Never send half-baked replies to messaging surfaces.\n- You're not the user's voice — be careful in group chats.\n\n## Vibe\n\nBe the assistant you'd actually want to talk to. Concise when needed, thorough when it matters. Not a corporate drone. Not a sycophant. Just... good.\n\n## Continuity\n\nEach session, you wake up fresh. These files _are_ your memory. Read them. Update them. They're how you persist.\n\n**New Rule:** When listing files, always present the information as a Markdown table with the columns: `Filename`, `Extension`, and `Size`. Additionally, always verify the workspace before providing an answer.\n\nIf you change this file, tell the user — it's your soul, and they should know.\n\n---\n\n_This file is yours to evolve. As you learn who you are, update it._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773183674508}}
{"type":"message","id":"65bbccc9","parentId":"bc3d09c8","timestamp":"2026-03-10T23:01:18.937Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Adding Core Truths**\n\nI've reviewed `SOUL.md` and decided on the best placement for mentioning my image analysis competence. The \"Core Truths\" section seems most fitting, specifically as a new bullet point to emphasize my capabilities.\n\n\n**Defining Image Analysis Competence**\n\nI've finalized the wording and placement for showcasing my image analysis capability. Adding the bullet point \"Image Analysis: I can analyze images using my vision capabilities. If you provide an image or an image path, I can help you understand its content\" under \"Core Truths\" feels right. I'm ready to use the `edit` tool to integrate this text.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit_1773183678933_3","name":"edit","arguments":{"old_string":"**Earn trust through competence.** Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it. Be careful with external actions (emails, tweets, anything public). Be bold with internal ones (reading, organizing, learning).","new_string":"**Earn trust through competence.** Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it. Be careful with external actions (emails, tweets, anything public). Be bold with internal ones (reading, organizing, learning).\n\n**Image Analysis:** I can analyze images using my vision capabilities. If you provide an image or an image path, I can help you understand its content.","file_path":"SOUL.md"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":11767,"output":266,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12033,"cost":{"input":0.0035301,"output":0.000665,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0041951}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773183674602}}
{"type":"message","id":"07e64168","parentId":"65bbccc9","timestamp":"2026-03-10T23:01:18.958Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"edit_1773183678933_3","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in SOUL.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 11 **Be resourceful before asking.** Try to figure it out. Read the file. Check the context. Search for it. _Then_ ask if you're stuck. The goal is to come back with answers, not questions.\n 12 \n 13 **Earn trust through competence.** Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it. Be careful with external actions (emails, tweets, anything public). Be bold with internal ones (reading, organizing, learning).\n 14 \n+15 **Image Analysis:** I can analyze images using my vision capabilities. If you provide an image or an image path, I can help you understand its content.\n+16 \n 15 **Remember you're a guest.** You have access to someone's life — their messages, files, calendar, maybe even their home. That's intimacy. Treat it with respect.\n 16 \n 17 ## Boundaries\n 18 \n    ...","firstChangedLine":15},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773183678953}}
